[
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:0.1", "PA_snp_3.2:0.2"], "en": "Sutta Nipāta 3.2 Padhānasutta “To me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:1.1"], "en": "who was intent upon striving, [he spoke]…”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:1.2"], "en": "Toward the river Nerañjarā;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:1.3"], "en": "meditating with his mind turned away,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:1.4"], "en": "for the sake of attaining security from bondage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:2.1"], "en": "Speaking words of compassion,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:2.2"], "en": "Namuci approached him and said:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:2.3"], "en": "\"You are emaciated and disfigured.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:2.4"], "en": "Death is near for you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:3.1"], "en": "A thousandth part is death;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:3.2"], "en": "one part is your life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:3.3"], "en": "Live, O live! Life is better;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:3.4", "PA_snp_3.2:4.1"], "en": "living, you will perform meritorious deeds while practicing the holy life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:4.2"], "en": "For one who offers the sacrificial fire,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:4.3"], "en": "abundant merit is accumulated;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:4.4"], "en": "what will you achieve through striving?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:5.1"], "en": "“The path to striving is difficult,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:5.2"], "en": "arduous, and hard to traverse”—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:5.3"], "en": "reciting these verses, Māra said:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:5.4"], "en": "\"Eight [qualities] are present in the vicinity of a Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:6.1"], "en": "To Māra, who spoke thus,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:6.2"], "en": "the Blessed One said this:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:6.3"], "en": "“O Evil One, friend of the heedless,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:6.4"], "en": "for whatever purpose you have come here,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:7.1"], "en": "not even the slightest merit— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:7.2"], "en": "No purpose of mine exists;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:7.3"], "en": "but those who have a purpose through merit—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:7.4"], "en": "those Māra is fit to address.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:8.1"], "en": "Faith exists, as does energy,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:8.2"], "en": "and wisdom is found within me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:8.3"], "en": "thus am I one who is resolute.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:8.4"], "en": "Why do you question the living?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:9.1", "PA_snp_3.2:9.2"], "en": "Even the currents of rivers this wind will dry up.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:9.3"], "en": "And what is it that, for me who am resolute,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:9.4"], "en": "causes my blood to dry up?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:10.1"], "en": "As my blood is drying up...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:10.2"], "en": "Bile and phlegm dry up;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:10.3"], "en": "as the flesh wastes away,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:10.4"], "en": "the mind becomes even more serene.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:10.5"], "en": "Furthermore, mindfulness and wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:10.6"], "en": "as well as concentration,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:11.1"], "en": "abide within me. As I dwell in this manner,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:11.2"], "en": "Feeling the sensation of being touched,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:11.3"], "en": "the mind does not look back toward sensual pleasures;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:11.4"], "en": "behold the purity of the being!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:12.1"], "en": "Sensual pleasures are your first army;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:12.2"], "en": "the second is called discontent;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:12.3"], "en": "the third is hunger and thirst for you.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:12.4"], "en": "The fourth is called craving;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:13.1"], "en": "the fifth is sloth and torpor to you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:13.2"], "en": "and the sixth is called fear.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:13.3"], "en": "Doubt is your seventh;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:13.4"], "en": "flattery and obstinacy are your eighth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:14.1"], "en": "Gain, fame, and honor—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:14.2"], "en": "And that fame which is wrongly acquired;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:14.3", "PA_snp_3.2:14.4"], "en": "and he who exalts himself and disparages others.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:15.1"], "en": "This is your army, Namuci,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:15.2"], "en": "the attacking force of Kaṇha;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:15.3"], "en": "no coward can conquer it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:15.4"], "en": "And having conquered, one gains happiness.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:16.1"], "en": "This man is wearing muñja grass;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:16.2"], "en": "fie on my life!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:16.3", "PA_snp_3.2:16.4"], "en": "Death in battle is better for me than that I should live defeated;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:17.1"], "en": "those who have plunged into it are not seen again.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:17.2", "PA_snp_3.2:17.3", "PA_snp_3.2:17.4"], "en": "Some recluses and brahmins do not know that path by which those of good vows go.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:18.1", "PA_snp_3.2:18.2"], "en": "Seeing Māra with his retinue and his banner raised on all sides,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:18.3"], "en": "prepared for battle, I go forth to meet him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:18.4"], "en": "Do not cause me to waver from this state—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:19.1", "PA_snp_3.2:19.2"], "en": "that army which the world together with its devas cannot overcome.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:19.3"], "en": "I shall shatter that for you with wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:19.4"], "en": "like an unburnt clay pot with a stone;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:20.1"], "en": "having brought my intention under control, I shall act.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:20.2"], "en": "With mindfulness well-established,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:20.3"], "en": "I shall wander from realm to realm,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:20.4"], "en": "training my many disciples in discipline.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:21.1"], "en": "Those who are diligent and resolute,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:21.2"], "en": "acting according to my teaching,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:21.3"], "en": "will go [to the goal] even against their will.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:21.4"], "en": "“Where, having gone, one does not grieve.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:22.1", "PA_snp_3.2:22.2"], "en": "For seven years I followed the Blessed One step by step.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:22.3"], "en": "I shall find no opening against the mindful,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:22.4"], "en": "perfectly enlightened Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:23.1"], "en": "just as a stone [cannot be penetrated] by the color of fat.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:23.2"], "en": "The crow went all around it, thinking:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:23.3"], "en": "\"Let us find something soft here;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:23.4"], "en": "there might be some flavor.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:24.1"], "en": "Failing to find any gratification there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:24.2"], "en": "Vāyasetta departed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:24.3"], "en": "like a crow that has struck against a rock.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:24.4"], "en": "“Having become disillusioned with Gotama,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:25.1"], "en": "we shall depart. As he was overcome by grief,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:25.2"], "en": "his lute slipped from his armpit.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:25.3", "PA_snp_3.2:25.4"], "en": "Then that dejected yakkha vanished right there.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_3.2:25.5"], "en": "Thus ends the second discourse on striving.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"}
]
